{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765735,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Marathon Madness","festival_id":504454,"organization_id":675999,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-18T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/marathon-madness-sant-longowal-institute-of-engineering-and-technology-longowal-punjab-1765735","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>Marathon Madness &ndash; Aarambh'26:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Overview:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Marathon Madness is a competitive running event under Aarambh'26 at SLIET Longowal. It brings together students for an exciting display of endurance, determination, discipline and physical fitness across multiple race categories.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 23\/09\/2026 (Wednesday)<\/li>\n<li>Time: 4:00 P.M.<\/li>\n<li>Venue: Auditorium<\/li>\n<li>Categories: 3 KM, 5 KM, 10 KM (exact distances &amp; start times decided by organizers)<\/li>\n<li>Route: Designated route within\/around campus with distance markers, direction signs &amp; volunteer checkpoints<\/li>\n<li>Participation: Individual (separate registration per category)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Judgement Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Completion Time &ndash; Total time from flag-off to finish line<\/li>\n<li>Adherence to Route &ndash; Following marked route &amp; checkpoints without shortcuts<\/li>\n<li>Endurance &amp; Pace Management &ndash; Consistency of pace and stamina across full distance<\/li>\n<li>Discipline &amp; Sportsmanship &ndash; Fair play and respect for all<\/li>\n<li>Overall Conduct &ndash; Composure, safety awareness and race completion within guidelines<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual participation; separate registration required<\/li>\n<li>Valid college ID mandatory; must be registered before event<\/li>\n<li>Report at starting point at least 15 minutes before flag-off<\/li>\n<li>Only registered participants allowed; no running under multiple registrations<\/li>\n<li>Must stay within marked route at all times; deviation may lead to disqualification<\/li>\n<li>Race marshal &amp; committee decisions on timing\/results are final<\/li>\n<li>Carry water &amp; wear appropriate running gear; organizers not responsible for personal injury from negligence<\/li>\n<li>Abusive behaviour, obstructing runners, property damage or disrespect = immediate disqualification<\/li>\n<li>Maintain discipline &amp; cleanliness along route<\/li>\n<li>In case of rain\/unavoidable circumstances, organizers may reschedule\/shorten\/modify race<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Certification Policy:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participation certificates for registered participants (subject to event policy)<\/li>\n<li>Certificates of excellence\/prizes for category winners &amp; other award categories<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Note:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to students of all eligible branches\/departments<\/li>\n<li>Race distance, route, timing &amp; format subject to change based on registrations &amp; availability<\/li>\n<li>Official Aarambh'26 organizing committee instructions are final<\/li>\n<li>Participants responsible for reporting on time &amp; following all instructions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Contact:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gaurav Kumar (Core Representative): 7991107815<\/li>\n<li>Anurag Kumar (Domain Coordinator): 8084674742<\/li>\n<li>Yash (Domain Co-Coordinator): 7742875275<\/li>\n<li>Saket (Event Coordinator): 7024450231<\/li>\n<li>Faculty Advisor: Mr. Digvesh Bharti, ME<\/li>\n<li>Faculty Conven<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":27463276,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-04T20:40:23+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T21:59:56+05:30","com